# Pre-push gate: typecheck + full test suite.
#
# This repo's main is a DERIVED ARTIFACT of the private monorepo
# (ABS-Projects-2026/Bastion); its mirror-sync action force-pushes main on
# every merge there. Human pushes to this repo should not happen at all
# post-Approach-B. This hook is defence in depth only, for the exceptional
# sanctioned push: this is the publish-canonical repo for bastion-scan, so
# anything pushed from a workstation must typecheck and pass the suite.
# (The sync action pushes with HUSKY=0; its own gate already ran the same
# suite against the derived tree.)
# Build before test, same order as the sync gate and release.yml: cli value
# imports resolve via shared/dist, so fresh or stale checkouts fail 4 tests unbuilt.
npm run typecheck && npm run build && npm run test
